WEBVTT

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:20.060
Those guys have definitely started 
to intrude upon our school life.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:22.560
They appeared at our social 
studies field trip,

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.230
and turned everyone into stone statues 
and manipulated the paintings,

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:26.590
so they would attack us.

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:28.410
And we found out at that art museum

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:31.510
that Mipple had come to our 
would a hundred years ago.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:37.140
But to Mepple and Mipple those 
hundred years were just one day.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:40.520
I have no idea what's going on anymore.

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:44.950
In any case, if the Prism 
Stones are taken away,

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:46.420
the Field of Light will be destroyed,

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:49.620
and all the worlds will be 
swallowed up by darkness.

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:52.390
I know that guys going to show up again.

00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:56.080
Can we protect Mepple and Mipple?

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:57.090
Nagisa...

00:00:58.130 --> 00:00:59.320
Nagisa!

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:03.350
Hey, Nagisa!

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:06.500
Come on, Nagisa! Nagisa!

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:10.610
I'm hungry mepo! Hurry, and feed me mepo.

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:15.110
Listen here! I'm not your mother.

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:19.080
Wow! You look exquisite today mepo.

00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:20.520
Really?

00:01:21.190 --> 00:01:23.570
How can you say that? My hair's a mess.

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:26.660
Even if it's a mess, you're still cute mepo.

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:30.470
You think so? Let's get your breakfast.

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:33.770
She's like putty in my hands mepo.

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:35.240
Did you say something?

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:37.230
I didn't say a thing mepo.

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:42.150
Good morning, Mepple, sir.

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:44.250
This morning, I've prepared grilled 
fish, "natto" (fermented soybeans),

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:47.920
dried  seaweed, and miso soup 
with daikon radish for you.

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.390
Sounds delicious!

00:01:49.550 --> 00:01:52.600
Reject! I want to eat udon 
noodles this morning mepo.

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:54.080
I want "kitsune udon" (udon 
noodles with fried tofu).

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.930
"Kitsune udon" in the morning?

00:01:55.930 --> 00:01:59.560
How about my specialty dish, rice omelette?

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:02.060
I had enough of that when we were 
living in the Field of the Light mepo.

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:04.340
I want to eat "kitsune udon" mepo

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:05.450
Here you are!

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:09.010
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:09.010 --> 00:02:11.810
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:14.650
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:18.920
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:21.890
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:24.760
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:26.660
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:02:27.860 --> 00:02:30.560
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:32.160
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:37.970
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:40.070
<i>become stronger</i>

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:43.840
<i>and closer</i>

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:47.850
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:50.420
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:53.580
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:56.450
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:56.450 --> 00:03:02.730
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:03.630
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:06.330
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:09.130
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:12.040
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:13.600
<i>Together we are</i>

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:16.670
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:23.320
You are pretty spoiled.

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:24.960
I'm a man among men.

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:27.110
Just call me a domineering husband mepo.

00:03:27.110 --> 00:03:28.110
Whose husband?

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:31.580
Mipple's future husband, of course mepo.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:35.210
Is that so? I'm going to eat breakfast, too.

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:36.550
Wait a minute mepo!

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:39.310
I have another favor to ask you mepo.

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:40.360
What kind of favor?

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:42.730
Mepple wants... Mepple wants...

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:46.270
Just one more...

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:50.660
Please give me one more 
chance, Jyaku-King, sir.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:53.710
My eternity is Dotsuku Zone's eternity.

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:57.090
My destruction is your destruction.

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:01.740
I promise you results.

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:10.160
"SERIOUS TROUBLE! 
A DESPERATE PISARD"

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:13.140
Did he underestimate his opponents too much,

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:14.810
or in the end, did he...?

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:16.820
He slacked off?

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:20.100
I knew it would be impossible 
for Pisard from the beginning.

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:25.070
I agree. He's the type to use 
trickery and fall into a trap.

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:30.040
He looks good, but on the other 
hand, is that all he has?

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:32.810
I don't think Pisard will bungle this,

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:36.480
but we'd better think of our next strategy.

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:39.450
I'll go. We're up against 
two young girls, aren't we?

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:41.430
You're just a kid yourself, aren't you?

00:04:41.430 --> 00:04:44.700
Skill has nothing to do with age.

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:45.920
Cut it out, will you?

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:48.900
Right now, we're talking 
about who's going next.

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:54.600
It doesn't matter who goes next. 
Anyone's better than Pisard.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:56.160
I agree. I agree.

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:04.270
Hurry! Hurry! Walk faster.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:07.410
Listen here! I'm not your errand boy.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.330
You're so cute mepo.

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:11.420
Your angry face is even cuter mepo.

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:13.960
I know I'm just putty in your hands.

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:15.580
You heard me this morning mepo.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:16.740
Of course!

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:19.930
What shall I do when I see Mipple mepo?

00:05:20.220 --> 00:05:24.870
If we show up all of a sudden, Yukishiro-san 
and Mipple may not be home.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:26.870
Of course they're home mepo!

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:29.400
I'm sure Mipple's waiting for me, too mepo.

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:31.290
I envy you!

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:35.050
You think the whole world 
revolves around you, don't you?

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:38.890
It revolves around me and Mipple mepo.

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:41.840
You wouldn't know since you 
don't have a boyfriend mepo.

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:43.350
None of your business!

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:45.190
If i had a mind to, I could...

00:05:45.770 --> 00:05:47.310
What are you doing mepo?

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:49.210
Quiet! Stay hidden for a while.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:55.620
I see! Good luck mepo.

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:59.450
It's not what you think!

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:01.310
Hello!

00:06:03.410 --> 00:06:08.100
I'm the one who brought back the 
soccer ball the other day at school.

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:11.940
Oh, yeah... Thanks for the other day.

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:14.830
Are you going to practice even on a Sunday?

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:16.850
We have a practice game today.

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:18.150
Do your best.

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:18.940
Thank you.

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:19.580
Bye!

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:20.270
Later...

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:22.220
Didn't I tell you mepo?

00:06:22.470 --> 00:06:26.380
Never mind! I told you it's 
not what you think, didn't I?

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:28.660
He's just an upperclassman in the Boys 
Division at our school, that's all...

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:31.470
I don't even know his name yet.

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:34.480
Never mind that!

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:36.940
Let's hurry, and go to see Mipple mepo.

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:38.780
What are you doing mepo?

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:40.310
Hurry, and call her mepo.

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:41.610
It's not that easy...

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:44.270
This house or should I call it a mansion...

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:46.310
Don't worry mepo.

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:49.340
Mipple and I love each other very much mepo.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:51.510
That may be true for you and Mipple,

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.850
but it's not like that 
with me and Yukishiro-san.

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:58.560
Misumi-san...?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:00.020
Yukishiro-san!

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:01.340
You came to see me?

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:03.600
I wanted to see you, too.

00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:05.400
Really?

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:10.220
The little one's been pestering me all 
morning about wanting to see Mepple, too.

00:07:10.220 --> 00:07:12.380
I was wondering what I should do.

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:15.350
Hey, Nagisa! Now do you see what 
the power of love is all about?

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:18.510
All right! I'm quite impressed, sir.

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:20.340
I missed you, Mipple mepo!

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:22.250
Me, too mipo!

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:30.910
They really get along well, don't they?

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:32.800
I envy them.

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:35.350
On the other hand, you could 
say it's downright hateful.

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:37.360
Who's hateful mepo?

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:40.170
Never mind! Just go ahead and play together.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:43.020
You don't have to tell us. 
We'll do it anyway mepo.

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:44.050
Right, Mipple?

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:44.970
That's right mipo.

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:46.420
Good Grief!

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:47.760
What about you, Misumi-san?

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:49.940
Don't you have a boyfriend?

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:52.090
You sure are direct, aren't you?

00:07:52.090 --> 00:07:53.910
Of course I don't!

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:56.280
So you're just like me...

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:59.280
But aren't you really popular with the boys?

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:01.870
Don't you get love letters all the time?

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:04.390
Not that often.

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:06.570
Maybe just once or twice a month.

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:08.530
That's often enough.

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:13.530
Compared to me, you're really popular.

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:18.120
If i get love letters, 
they're always from girls...

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:19.390
It's the pits.

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:24.480
Being popular with the girls is 
proof that you're a wonderful girl.

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:25.510
Is it?

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:27.160
I'm sure it is.

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:30.440
I'm sure you'll find a 
wonderful boyfriend someday.

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:31.990
I hope so.

00:08:33.220 --> 00:08:35.620
Isn't there someone you're interested in?

00:08:38.960 --> 00:08:41.680
No! Not at all!

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:42.590
What about you?

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:45.880
If I'm going to date someone,

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:49.400
my ideal is to have a relationship 
where we both respect each other.

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:51.330
Sounds complicated to me.

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:53.350
I have a bad feeling mepo...

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:54.380
Bad feeling?

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:55.870
Me, too mipo!

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:01.170
Don't tell me...!

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:02.310
Hey, baby!

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:03.920
Just my type!

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:05.770
What are you doing?

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:06.620
No way!

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:08.870
Would you like to take a drive with us?

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:10.980
On our super "mamachari" 
(single-speed lady's bicycle).

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:13.920
Absolutely no way!

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:16.250
Don't you want to come and play?

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:18.480
Let's go to the game center.

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:20.140
We're...

00:09:20.140 --> 00:09:21.050
Let's go!

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:22.690
Let go of me!

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:24.290
What's your name?

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:25.360
Get away from me!

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:28.040
What right do you have to try 
and force us to come with you?

00:09:28.240 --> 00:09:30.770
Besides, when you ask someone's name,

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:32.550
you're supposed to give your 
name first, aren't you?

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:35.000
My name is "Nanpaman" (the pick-up man).

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:37.710
What's so funny?

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:41.930
Don't pay any attention to guys like that.

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:45.310
I'm hungry.

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:47.700
That's because you took 
those guys so seriously.

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:49.500
But come to think of it, I'm...

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:50.640
Let's get something to eat.

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:51.750
What do you want to eat?

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:52.360
How about "taiyaki" 
(fish-shaped cake filled with bean paste)?

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:54.830
"Taiyaki" for lunch?

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:55.660
No good?

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:57.260
It's not that...

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:58.510
Then how about fried noodles?

00:09:58.510 --> 00:09:59.590
What about pasta?

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.290
"Okonomiyaki"...? 
(Japanese styled pancakes)

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:02.340
How about pizza?

00:10:02.340 --> 00:10:04.060
I wouldn't mind having 
"nabeyaki" udon (noodles in a hot pot)...

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:08.170
Do you like foods that have 
the word "yaki" in them?

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:10.530
It's not that...

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:11.530
That's right!

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:14.190
Hello, Akane-san!

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:17.410
Nagisa! Long time no see! How have you been?

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:19.440
Fine! Give me two "takoyaki" 
(octopus dumplings).

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:20.260
Okay.

00:10:20.980 --> 00:10:22.430
It's really delicious.

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:24.790
Is this the first time you're 
having our "takoyaki"?

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:25.560
Yes.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:26.140
From the lacrosse team?

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:27.770
We're in the same class.

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:30.750
Akane used to be the captain 
of the lacrosse team.

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:32.790
How long ago was that?

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:35.580
Idiot! That would reveal my age!

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:36.190
Wouldn't it?

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:38.880
Pleased to meet you. I'm Honoka Yukishiro.

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:41.280
Nice to meet you. I'm Akane Fujita.

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:44.860
It's unusual to see you 
with someone like her.

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:48.080
You think so? I didn't really notice...

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.430
Here you go!

00:10:49.430 --> 00:10:50.330
Looks delicious!

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:54.910
How is it?

00:10:54.910 --> 00:10:56.050
It's delicious!

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:59.090
It feels so soft and fluffy in my 
mouth, and it just melts in my mouth.

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:01.070
Doesn't it? It's good, isn't it?

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:04.790
And Akane-san seems like 
a really nice person.

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:07.040
Like a reliable older sister.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:10.290
That's why I stop by here often on 
my way home from our team practice.

00:11:10.540 --> 00:11:13.010
Akane-san wanted to have her own business,

00:11:13.010 --> 00:11:15.490
so she quit her job at a big company,

00:11:15.490 --> 00:11:17.600
and she's training over there.

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:21.220
But I wonder why she picked 
"Takoyaki" as a business?

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:25.640
Let me try.

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:29.120
It's impossible for a beginner.

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:33.690
Thank you.

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:34.960
What shall we do now?

00:11:35.230 --> 00:11:36.070
What...?

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:38.300
Hurry, and eat, and lets go somewhere.

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:38.950
Somewhere?

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:42.660
Someplace fun, or where the 
two of us can be alone.

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:44.700
I wouldn't know where to go...

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:46.110
What about the library?

00:11:46.110 --> 00:11:48.120
What would we do at the library?

00:11:48.490 --> 00:11:51.540
How about somewhere you want to go?

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:54.400
How about this one?

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:56.120
Does it look too grown-up?

00:11:56.870 --> 00:12:02.250
It's wonderful, but I think something 
more cute would be better for you.

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:06.340
You think so? Why don't I look good 
in anything that's more grown-up?

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:07.750
That's not true...

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:09.960
Why don't you try it on?

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:11.980
I don't have money today, so I can't buy it,

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:13.610
but maybe i can try it on.

00:12:15.930 --> 00:12:17.890
What is it mepo? Don't bother us mepo!

00:12:17.890 --> 00:12:20.050
The two of you are in the way.

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:22.820
That's right. This is for trying on clothes.

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:24.850
You're so mean, Honoka mipo.

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:27.380
No matter what you wear, it 
won't do any good, Nagisa mepo.

00:12:27.380 --> 00:12:29.110
You'll never be popular with boys mepo.

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:33.270
I don't know whether they're 
cute or hateful sometimes.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:35.440
What do you think of their attitudes?

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:37.790
You're so funny, Misumi-san.

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:39.830
I really enjoy myself when I'm with you.

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:41.170
Really?

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:43.700
You're sure you're not just forcing yourself?

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:44.770
Not at all.

00:12:44.770 --> 00:12:46.740
Never mind that. Hurry, and try that on.

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:51.580
I'll see you again.

00:12:51.760 --> 00:12:53.630
Bye... See you tomorrow.

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:54.390
Mepple!

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:55.610
Mipple!

00:12:56.310 --> 00:12:57.910
Bye.

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:25.800
I don't know...

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:27.160
What's wrong mepo?

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:29.190
Just as Akane-san said,

00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:33.630
we live in different worlds and our 
interests aren't the same either.

00:13:33.630 --> 00:13:34.820
Are you talking about Honoka mepo?

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:37.970
I feel like she's trying to hard.

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:39.290
I don't really feel comfortable.

00:13:39.490 --> 00:13:41.110
It can't be helped mepo.

00:13:41.110 --> 00:13:42.790
You're too childish mepo.

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:44.140
What did you say?

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:47.730
Oh, no! I forgot to give 
this back to Yukishiro-san.

00:13:47.730 --> 00:13:48.950
You're such a bungler mepo.

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:50.560
Hurry, and bring it back to here mepo.

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:52.720
I can see Mipple again mepo.

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:54.260
That was fun, wasn't it?

00:13:54.260 --> 00:13:56.480
Let's all play together again mipo.

00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:01.210
So you enjoyed yourself that much, huh?

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:03.830
We'll have more fun.

00:14:07.350 --> 00:14:09.050
Hasn't she come home yet?

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:12.860
No... I wonder where she got side-tracked.

00:14:12.860 --> 00:14:15.190
I wonder if she stopped at the library.

00:14:15.590 --> 00:14:18.830
I borrowed this from her. 
Can you return it to her?

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:21.150
You came here just for that...?

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:22.670
How nice of you.  Thank you.

00:14:23.030 --> 00:14:25.170
Be careful on your way home.

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:26.880
I will. Goodbye.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:31.010
I wonder if she really went to the library.

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:32.500
Let's look for her mepo.

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:34.630
But I already returned her handkerchief.

00:14:34.630 --> 00:14:37.090
I have a bad feeling about this mepo.

00:14:37.090 --> 00:14:39.390
Don't say that!

00:14:42.670 --> 00:14:44.030
So? are you having fun?

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:47.000
She wasn't here, after all.

00:14:45.560 --> 00:14:51.040
Wakabadai Library

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:48.690
I wonder if we missed 
each other along the way.

00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:50.020
What are you going to do mepo?

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:51.030
Do what?

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:54.600
I'm so worried about Mipple I 
can just can't bear it mepo.

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:57.710
Aren't you worried about Honoka mepo?

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:59.780
I am, but...

00:14:59.780 --> 00:15:01.970
I'm sure she had something she had to do.

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:03.090
Let's go home.

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:06.570
You're so heartless, Nagisa mepo!

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:12.960
No more games.

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:15.280
I won't give you the Prism Stones.

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:18.930
Do you think I'll let you do 
as you please with this world?

00:15:21.740 --> 00:15:23.110
You poor thing.

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:25.550
It looks like you can't transform 
when you're by yourself.

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:32.110
Just hand over the Prism 
Stones and I'll let you live.

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:37.670
Why are you trying to take away 
something precious to someone else?

00:15:37.670 --> 00:15:39.550
Do you have any right to do that?

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:43.510
If Jyaku-King lives eternally, 
Dotsuku Zone lives eternally.

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:46.840
And if Dotsuku Zone lives 
eternally, so will I.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:48.300
So you're saying as long 
as it's good for you,

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.000
you don't care about 
anything else, aren't you?

00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:52.440
That's so wrong!

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:54.390
I don't know what you're talking about...

00:15:54.590 --> 00:15:57.560
All I know is, I have 
to do what I have to do.

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:58.870
Hand over the Prism Stones!

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:00.090
I won't give them to you.

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:01.730
How could I?

00:16:03.220 --> 00:16:04.730
Than it can't be helped.

00:16:10.880 --> 00:16:14.700
If you think you're right, than prove it.

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.950
What can a powerless person like you do?

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:18.660
No...

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:21.410
You're wrong.

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:22.800
Talk all you want!

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:31.100
Honoka!

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:38.970
So what do you think? This is reality.

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:40.330
It's time you faced it.

00:16:40.510 --> 00:16:43.310
No... I absolutely refuse!

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:45.050
In that case...

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:46.510
Wait a minute!

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:49.730
Misumi-san...

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:52.470
The power of love is incredible, 
isn't it, Yukishiro-san?

00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:53.430
The power of love?

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:55.920
We came to save you, Mipple mepo.

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:56.700
Mepple!

00:16:57.050 --> 00:17:00.150
No matter what you may say

00:17:00.150 --> 00:17:04.630
you're the ones who are wrong for trying to 
take something that belongs to someone else!

00:17:04.630 --> 00:17:05.830
I'm glad you're here.

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:06.830
I have to hand it to you.

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:08.150
Are you okay?

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:14.890
Can you defeat me if you can't transform?

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:24.490
Come at me with all you've got.

00:17:24.490 --> 00:17:27.080
I promise you. I'll get 
the Prism Stones from you.

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:29.060
Hurry, and transform mepo!

00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:42.840
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:27.220
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:30.080
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:33.670
Together, we are Pretty Cure!

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:37.290
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:40.730
Go back to where you came from!

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:44.060
This is getting interesting.

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:01.240
Hang in there mipo!

00:19:06.430 --> 00:19:08.870
What?

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:47.640
Black! Are you okay mepo?

00:19:47.640 --> 00:19:49.660
Pull yourself together, White mipo!

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:52.930
What's wrong? Is that the 
extent of your powers?

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:59.570
I'll show you what happens 
to hypocrites like you!

00:19:59.570 --> 00:20:00.770
Bet for your life!

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:05.780
I'll let the first one to 
beg for her life, live.

00:20:06.460 --> 00:20:08.170
Are you kidding!

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:12.750
You're wrong... You're absolutely wrong!

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.220
Then what are you going to do?

00:20:14.220 --> 00:20:16.820
You already know what we'll do, don't you?

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:20.920
Black Thunder!

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:22.410
White Thunder!

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:34.300
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:20:34.550 --> 00:20:36.920
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:41.140
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:20:48.420 --> 00:20:51.970
In any world, it's either one 
or the other... win or lose?

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:57.930
Bow down to my power, and quietly 
hand over the Prism Stones!

00:20:58.210 --> 00:21:00.400
You know we can't do that!

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:04.410
Using your powers to get what you want...

00:21:04.800 --> 00:21:07.310
I absolutely refuse to acknowledge it.

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:10.170
You still don't seem to understand, do you?

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:11.940
No matter how hard you try to resist,

00:21:11.940 --> 00:21:16.400
you're all destined to be 
swallowed up by Dotsuku Zone.

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:19.800
Just submit to the will of Jyaku-King!

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:21.440
Don't take us for fools!

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:24.010
We're all living our lives in earnest.

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:27.270
We live our lives understanding 
and respecting each other!

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:30.480
How dare you try to take 
control of everybody!

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:32.970
It's absolutely wrong!

00:21:34.150 --> 00:21:34.910
What?

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:43.280
This can't be! How...?

00:21:49.920 --> 00:21:53.730
Is this really the end?

00:21:53.730 --> 00:21:54.560
Probably.

00:21:54.560 --> 00:21:57.400
Don't tell me that we...?

00:22:00.430 --> 00:22:01.990
Don't worry mepo.

00:22:01.990 --> 00:22:04.810
He just went back to the 
world of darkness mepo.

00:22:04.810 --> 00:22:08.480
He won't ever return in 
that scary form again mipo.

00:22:08.480 --> 00:22:10.340
Never mind that... What is this?

00:22:16.210 --> 00:22:17.570
This is...

00:22:18.070 --> 00:22:20.220
A Prism Stone!

00:22:22.220 --> 00:22:25.260
<i>Ah- Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.090 --> 00:22:29.190
<i>Get you! L-O-V-E Love Love!</i>

00:22:29.190 --> 00:22:29.930
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:32.530
<i>I can't do this! I'd rather be a</i>

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:35.570
<i>young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:38.100
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:42.140
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:47.910
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:52.250
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:55.320
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:59.820
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:06.330
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:13.940
<i>I'm a teenager with a heart 
throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:20.450
<i>I don't want to lose that 
normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:23.180
<i>I just can't do this! 
It's romance rather than</i>

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:26.420
<i>stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.590
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode.</i>

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:32.190
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:35.390
<i>I just can't do this! I'd rather cuddle</i>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:40.430
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:43.100
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:49.670
<i>So why am I stuffing my face 
with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:53.320 --> 00:23:58.010
Once upon a time, Misumi-san and 
I went searching for Prism jewels.

00:23:58.010 --> 00:24:02.070
And a large Moai came 
floating down the river....

00:24:02.070 --> 00:24:02.960
No way!

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:05.480
Misumi-san, that's a new 
enemy from Dotsuku Zone.

00:24:05.480 --> 00:24:07.640
It's a lot bigger than the bear.

00:24:07.640 --> 00:24:09.540
What luck I have!

00:24:11.000 --> 00:24:13.730
"A NEW DARKNESS! 
THE BEAR IN THE DANGEROUS FOREST!"

00:24:13.890 --> 00:24:17.440
What's more scary than the 
Dotsuku Zone monsters?

00:24:17.440 --> 00:24:20.180
My mom.
 She's really scary!
